    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "Kaaleen telekcock\nN1025V\nPAA\nYANKEE CLIPPERS CARRY ON\nCLIPPER, TRADEMARK, REG. U. S. PAT. OFF.",
      "PaD tips its hat\non Hellin\nTillon\nthese\nPeters\nyear employees!\nfois you\nOne hundred fifty years' service with Pan American World Airways is\nthe occasion for our celebration tonight - - a celebration to honor as\nguests the six fellow employees whose pictures appear on this page.\nEach of them has completed 25 years' service with the Company, thus\nqualifying for the \"Quarter Century Club, \" the membership of which\nis both distinctive and limited.\nTwenty-five years is almost back to \"the beginning of time\" in terms\nof the Company's life. It is the most progressive half of the history of\npowered flight. During this period each of our Quarter Century members\nhas, in his own sphere, contributed in large measure to the Company's\ngrowth and development, and to the progress of air transportation in\ngeneral. It should be a source of considerable pride to each of them,\nas it is to us, that they have had a part in numerous accomplishments\nwhich are aviation history.\nWe now look forward to a continuing pleasant association with our\nhonored guests.\nMay the coming years be happy ones for them -\nyears in which their contributions will continue to redound to their\nbenefit, as well as to the further development of the World's Most\nExperienced Airline.\nPan American World Airways\nPacific-Alaska Division\nLaras lu Goma\nExecutive Vice President\nShit\nIN GREEN HILLS COUNTRY CLUB\nNAde hourie\nDecember 11061 muzare\nZabank\nMarinde;\nYe meNe Beecher\nOLIVES\n- Maxall\nCONSOMME DE VOLAILLE\nEVIN - GRENACHE ROSE, ALMADEN\nCÔTE DE BOEUF RÔTIE AU JUS\nPOMMES DE TERRE PONT NEUF\nHARICOTS VERTS ALMONDINE\nSALADE DE LAITUE\nPAA\nPETITS PAINS\nFLAN AUX POMMES\nBEURRE\nFRONAGE\n\"JACK\" POINDEXTER\n\"HAL\" DE NOURIE\n\"WALT\" ZIEGLER\nCARE\nKATHLEEN HITCHCOCK\nRALPH BEECHER\n\"LAN\" TURNER"
    ],
